# Inspect what merging this PR would do to the live cluster.
#   apply-delta applies the base->head delta (add/update/retract/unchanged).
#   rbac::diff is the pass/fail check: any permission expansion exits 1.
#   diff-relation is a diagnostic view of one relation (never pass/fail).
source ../cluster-admin-approved/cluster-admin-approved.mg
snapshot base
apply-delta base/ head/
rbac::diff base
diff-relation base unexpected_cluster_admin
